ator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value got 133% of normal in April to May and 46% in November to December. For 2026 so far, the county&rsquo;s middle value shows 35% of normal in January to February and 34% in February to March.</p>"}
